<view class="page"><scene-backdrop/><view class="title">本场成绩</view><view wx:if="{{loading}}" class="card">正在读取…</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="card"><view>{{error}}</view><button bindtap="load">重新加载</button></view><block wx:if="{{share}}"><view class="sub">{{share.title}} · {{share.date}}</view><view class="note">只读分享 · 版本 {{share.version}}<text wx:if="{{share.updated}}"> · 成绩已更新，显示最新版本</text></view><view wx:if="{{share.status==='revising'}}" class="card">赛事正在修订，此处保留上一次公布的正式结果。</view><view wx:for="{{share.players}}" wx:key="index" class="card space"><view class="row"><text>{{item.name}} · {{item.tee}}</text><text>{{item.rank?'第 '+item.rank+' 名':''}}</text></view><view class="section">{{item.total}} 杆 · {{item.played}}/{{item.holes}} 洞</view><view class="note">{{item.courseName}} {{item.routeName}} {{item.state}}</view><view wx:for="{{item.scores}}" wx:for-item="score" wx:for-index="holeIndex" wx:key="index" class="row menu"><text>{{share.holes[holeIndex].label}} · Par {{share.holes[holeIndex].par}}</text><text>{{score}}</text></view></view><view class="note">只累计实际记录；空白、跳洞和捡球不补标准杆。此链接不会授予编辑或参赛权限。</view></block></view><privacy-panel/><qy-dialog class="page-dialog"/>
